Hotbar Studio is an original plugin by Roxyz0501 (MIT).
Uses Dalamud (goatcorp, https://github.com/goatcorp/Dalamud, AGPL-3.0) as a host-provided plugin SDK.
Uses FFXIVClientStructs public structures and local user-file/hotbar APIs
(aers and contributors, https://github.com/aers/FFXIVClientStructs, MIT).
Uses Lumina and Lumina.Excel as host-provided game data libraries.
These dependencies are provided by Dalamud and are not bundled in the release archive.
No third-party or game artwork is included in the original plugin icon.
In-game action icons are obtained from the installed game through Dalamud's texture provider.
The persistence implementation and native UI test renderer adapt shared project code
from Command Atlas by Roxyz0501 (MIT); no upstream plugin repository was cloned.
Command syntax reference: Square Enix Lodestone text command documentation.
